  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Unaccompanied Migrant Children at the Northern Greek Borders and Lesvos Safe Area (MERIMNA III &#x2013; Protection at Greek Borders)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the ongoing national efforts to improve the well-being and access to fundamental rights of UMC arriving to the Greek islands  and the RIC of Evros (Fylakio) by supporting  UMCs living in the Lesvos SA and in the Fylakio RIC, to have access to immediate assistance in line with their best interest and fundamental rights.</narrative>
  </description>
